## Interface: 16001
## Title: HUF - Hivemind Unitframes
## Notes: Dark, minimalist unit frames (player, target, target of target, pet, group, nameplates), damage meter, minimap and click-casting. Works with MMT's privacy settings. Type /huf for settings.
